OL,3,AOscar-winning film producer Jeremy
OL,4,AThomas dies aged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FOscar-winning producer Jeremy Thomas,
OL,7,Fwhose films included The Last Emperor
OL,8,Fand Sexy Beast, has died aged 77.
OL,10,FThe British filmmaker "passed away
OL,11,Fpeacefully" surrounded by family and
OL,12,Floved ones at his home in Oxfordshire
OL,13,Fon Friday, his publicist said in a
OL,14,Fstatement.
OL,16,FThomas built an international
OL,17,Freputation over a career spanning five
OL,18,Fdecades, working with directors
OL,19,Fincluding David Cronenberg, Nagisa
OL,20,FOshima, Julien Temple and Nicolas Roeg
OL,21,Fand backing independent films alongside
OL,22,Fmainstream successes.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
